/S /H2
/P 199 0 R
/T ("This planner was born from an accessible but profound realization: we spend our lives chasing goals when we should be architecting identities. The persona we strive to become is the very foundation of the results we seek. After years of struggling with traditional planning, I mastered this process and shared it with those closest to me. Now, goals manifest naturally because we apply elementary still transformative techniques.")
